///   consumer with its own 2MB/s per shard read throughput, delivered over HTTP/2 push
///   rather than polling. Enhanced fan-out requires the IAM permissions
///   `kinesis:DescribeStreamConsumer` and `kinesis:SubscribeToShard`, and incurs
///   additional AWS charges per consumer-shard-hour plus data retrieval. The named
///   consumer is registered automatically on first use and is never deregistered; that
///   registration additionally requires `kinesis:RegisterStreamConsumer`, which may be
///   omitted when a consumer with the configured name already exists on every stream (for
///   example one provisioned through infrastructure-as-code).
///
/// ## Table schema
